ng the hilt with iron adds weight to the blade while also increasing chopping power."},"atkVal":"5","price":"2000","slot":{"zh":"武器","en":"Weapon"}},{"id":"WP1009205","name":{"zh":"山纹护心甲·丁","en":"Mountain Heart Guard - IV"},"level":"1","description":{"zh":"在山纹甲的基础上额外添加了一件铁护心，通常由校尉或伍长穿戴。","en":"Mountain-pattern armor with an added iron heart guard, typically worn by captains or squad leaders."},"defenceVal":"10","price":"6000","slot":{"zh":"护甲","en":"Armor"}},{"id":"WP1020705","name":{"zh":"先锋盔·乙","en":"Vanguard Helm - II"},"level":"1","description":{"zh":"据说比常规铁盔多一道稳固工序，并且会用特制盔沿的头盔，多为陷阵冲锋之人佩戴。","en":"A helmet said to undergo an extra reinforcing process compared to standard iron helmets, featuring a specially crafted brim. Mostly worn by those who charge enemy lines."},"defenceVal":"4","price":"2400","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}}],"family":{"father":{"label":{"zh":"父亲","en":"Father"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10003","code":"0"}]},"otherRelationship":{"label":{"zh":"其他关系","en":"Other relationships"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10208","code":"8"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI112215","name":{"zh":"雁门张氏","en":"The Zhang Clan of Yanmen"},"years":["0","999"],"desc":{"zh":"出自姬姓，本为聂氏。其先祖是西汉武帝时“马邑之谋”的发起者、富商聂壹。后人为避祸改姓张，世代居于雁门马邑。张辽是“五子良将”之首，战功赫赫，威震逍遥津。其子张虎、孙张统相继袭爵，家族在曹魏享有崇高军事和政治地位，是并州雁门郡最具代表性的武力世家。","en":"Descended from the Ji surname, originally of the Nie clan. Their ancestor was Nie Yi, a wealthy merchant who initiated the ‘Plot of Mayi’ during the reign of Emperor Wu of the Western Han. His descendants changed their surname to Zhang to avoid disaster, residing in Mayi of Yanmen for generations. Zhang Liao was foremost among the ‘Five Elite Generals’, renowned for his illustrious military exploits and fearsome valor at Xiaoyaojin. His son Zhang Hu and grandson Zhang Tong inherited his nobility titles in succession. The Family enjoyed high military and political standing in Cao Wei, serving as the most representative martial clan of Yanmen Commandery in Bing Province."},"talent":{"military":"8","commerce":"1","politics":"6"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":null,"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1051","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[75,74,51,34,61,68],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"350","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1009205","helmet":"WP1020705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10215","name":{"zh":"汉末三杰","en":"Three Heroes of the Late Han"},"year":"185","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1051","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[75,74,51,34,61,68],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"350","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1009205","helmet":"WP1020705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10615","name":{"zh":"十常侍之乱","en":"Turmoil of the Ten Attendants"},"year":"188","month":"11"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1051","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[75,74,51,34,61,68],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1009205","helmet":"WP1020705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10402","name":{"zh":"诸侯讨董","en":"Coalition Against Dong Zhuo"},"year":"190","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1051","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[75,74,51,34,61,68],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1009205","helmet":"WP1020705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10208","name":{"zh":"幽燕龙兴","en":"Dragon Rises in Youyan"},"year":"191","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1051","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[75,74,51,34,61,68],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1009205","helmet":"WP1020