uthern Campaign"},"year":"225","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10104","city":"CS1051","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[75,74,51,34,61,68],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"100","reputation":"2500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1009205","helmet":"WP1020705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1051","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[75,74,51,34,61,68],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"100","reputation":"2500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1009205","helmet":"WP1020705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1051","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[75,74,51,34,61,68],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"100","reputation":"2500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1009205","helmet":"WP1020705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1051","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[75,74,51,34,61,68],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"100","reputation":"2500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1009205","helmet":"WP1020705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1013","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[75,74,51,34,61,68],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"100","reputation":"2500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1009205","helmet":"WP1020705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1051","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[75,74,51,34,61,68],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1009205","helmet":"WP1020705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10104","city":"CS1013","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[75,74,51,34,61,68],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1009205","helmet":"WP1020705"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"魏国武将，张辽之子，与乐綝多为搭档出军。诸葛亮复出祁山北伐时担任曹真部下，与乐綝为先锋部队将领。后因司马懿败于诸葛亮而与乐綝一同被捕，被涂面后放还。诸葛亮第五次北伐中奉司马懿之命伏杀吴班。其第六次北伐时又与乐綝共同解救被困于上方谷的司马懿。后随司马懿平定辽东叛乱时生擒公孙渊父子立功。","tc":"魏國武將，張遼之子，與樂綝多為搭檔出軍。諸葛亮復出祁山北伐時擔任曹真部下，與樂綝為先鋒部隊將領。后因司馬懿敗于諸葛亮而與樂綝一同被捕，被涂面后放還。諸葛亮第五次北伐中奉司馬懿之命伏殺吳班。其第六次北伐時又與樂綝共同解救被困于上方谷的司馬懿。后隨司馬懿平定遼東叛亂時生擒公孫淵父子立功。","en":"An officer of Wei, the son of Zhang Liao, who frequently partnered with Yue Lin in the field. During Zhuge Liang's renewed Northern Expedition from Qishan, he served under Cao Zhen alongside Yue Lin as vanguard. After Sima Yi was defeated by Zhuge Liang, he and Yue Lin were captured and released after their faces were painted in humiliation. During Zhuge Liang's fifth Northern Expedition, he carried out Sima Yi's orders to ambush and kill Wu Ban. During the sixth expedition, he and Yue Lin rescued Sima Yi from the trap at Shangfang Valley. He later accompanied Sima Yi in crushing the Liaodong rebellion, capturing Gongsun Yuan and his son.","jp":"魏の武将。張遼の子。楽綝と組んで出陣することが多かった。諸葛亮が再び祁山へ北伐した際には曹真の配下となり、楽綝と共に先鋒部隊を率いた。後に司馬懿が諸葛亮に敗れると楽綝と共に捕らえられ、顔に墨を塗られた上で釈放された。諸葛亮の五度目の北伐では司馬懿の命を受けて伏兵となり、呉班を討ち取った。六度目の北伐でも楽綝と共に上方谷に包囲された司馬懿を救出した。後に司馬懿に従って遼東の反乱平定に赴き、公孫淵父子を生け捕りにする功績を挙げた。","kr":"위나라의 무장이자 장료의 아들로, 주로 악침과 짝을 이루어 출진했다. 제갈량이 기산으로 다시 나와 북벌을 일으켰을 때 조진의 휘하에서 악침과 함께 선봉 부대의 장수로 나섰다. 이후 사마의가 제갈량에게 패하면서 악침과 함께 사로잡혔으나, 얼굴에 먹칠을 당한 채 풀려났다. 제갈량의 5차 북벌 때는 사마의의 명을 받아 매복하여 오반을 사살했다. 6차 북벌 때에도 악침과 함께 상방곡에 갇힌 사마의를 구출했다. 이후 사마의를 따라 요동의 난을 평정할 때 공손연 부자를 생포하는 공을 세웠다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10207","remark":"","surname":"张","surnameTc":"張","surnameEn":"Zhang","surnameJp":"張","surnameKr":"장","surnameOther":"","name":"虎","nameTc":"虎","nameEn":"Hu","nameJp":"虎","nameKr":"호","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"张虎","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"209","city":"CS1051","gender":"0","rule":"75","force":"74","wise":"51","politics":"34","charm":"61","will":"68","ruleTalent":"9","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"2","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"25/73/25/25/25/14/50/25","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1012205","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5600","battleSoulPoint":"5400","debateSoulPoint":"2600","strategy":"1007115","strategy2":"1010601","professions":"3/2/3/2/2/0/2/0/0/0/0/0/1/0/3/0/0/1/0/1/0/1/2/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"15","loyalty":"0","reputation":"600","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"195","show":"209","death":"240","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"2","weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1009205","helmet":"WP1020705","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;1/1;10/1;25/1;31/1;9/1;30/0","father":"WJ10003/0","mother":"","children":"","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"WJ10208/8","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYear":"0","description":"魏国武将，张辽之子，与乐綝多为搭档出军。诸葛亮复出祁山北伐时担任曹真部下，与乐綝为先锋部队将领。后因司马懿败于诸葛亮而与乐綝一同被捕，被涂面后放还。诸葛亮第五次北伐中奉司马懿之命伏杀吴班。其第六次北伐时又与乐綝共同解救被困于上方谷的司马懿。后随司马懿平定辽东叛乱时生擒公孙渊父子立功。","descriptionTc":"魏國武將，張遼之子，與樂綝多為搭檔出軍。諸葛亮復出祁山北伐時擔任曹真部下，與樂綝為先鋒部隊將領。后因司馬懿敗于諸葛亮而與樂綝一同被捕，被涂面后放還。